    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Text From the Police",
      "",
      "Recently, everyone living in Shanghai has received the same text message.",
      "The Shanghai Police Department wants to remind everyone ..",
      ".. that traffic behavior like running red lights, jay-walking, casually parking one’s car, and randomly honking all are illegal.",
      "China’s traffic is very dangerous at the moment, there are many traffic accidents.",
      "One reason is that many drivers have insufficient experience. They only recently received their driver’s license, and only recently started driving.",
      "Another reason that many people living in Shanghai only recently moved to Shanghai.",
      "They lived in a village before, and don’t have that much of a concept of traffic rules.",
      "There’s one more reason, which is that Chinese traffic police rarely give out fines.",
      "Except for grave violations, like driving under the influence, overloading, or driving against traffic, ..",
      ".. it seems like the law-breaking of Chinese people is “free of charge.”"
    ]
  }
